ight=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3316712e-5ee5-4aab-a17c-75d9b1e9a7d4\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHover over the Inspector settings of any Label.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112414/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}